Head title 2


Before any new  ter-
minal can be connec-
ted  to  a  computer
system,  however, an
appropriate   inter-
face   must   exist.
This      interface,
inevitably involving
both system hardware
and  software,  must
cope    with     the
terminal's    speed,
character set,  line
discipline,  special
features,  lack   of

