TERMINAL  PROPERTIES
While it is the dif-
ferences     between
types   that  brings
about the  need  for
identification,   it
is often these  dif-
ferences that permit
identification.  The
properties and abil-
ities  of  terminals
may   be  classified
and   examined   for

